429
00:29:19.750 --> 00:29:24.370
Ja gain more,
more territory and their aim is now

430
00:29:24.370 --> 00:29:28.930
to go even beyond the west coast of,
the west coast of Yemen.

431
00:29:29.370 --> 00:29:33.130
They are embodent, they like the,
the attention of the international

432
00:29:33.130 --> 00:29:37.010
community,
they like that now everyone is, is,

433
00:29:37.010 --> 00:29:39.510
is talking about them.
And now they are hitting Saudi

434
00:29:39.610 --> 00:29:42.290
-Araabia and they will keep hitting
them hard. Kas nüüd,

435
00:29:42.390 --> 00:29:46.050
kui tuul on korralikult tiibades, ei
või huttidest saada uus ISIS

436
00:29:46.050 --> 00:29:49.190
